+        // MAOS: grant carrier privileges to the bundled Communicate app
+        // (com.vayunmathur.communicate) regardless of UICC access rules, so
+        // single-registration RCS works on carriers whose profiles carry no
+        // rules (e.g. Jibe-backed MVNOs). Real UICC grants still take
